#
# File: 260-ARP-NonEthernet-htype-in-monitor.rule
# Policy: Monitor ARP packets advertising Frame Relay hardware type
# Description:
#     Runs after ARP hook and zone interface map/vmap dispatch; no interface matching here.
#     HTYPE 15 denotes Frame Relay; such frames may not traverse Linux nftables arp hooks.
#     Direction: remote-to-local; intended for arp input hook.
#
arp htype 15 counter comment "remote-to-local NonEthernet htype monitor"
